        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    spot_rate_short = 0.025\n    spot_rate_long = 0.035\n    period_short = 2\n    period_long = 5\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    forward_rate = (\n        ((1 + spot_rate_long) ** period_long)\n        / ((1 + spot_rate_short) ** period_short)\n    ) ** (1 / (period_long - period_short)) - 1\n\n    answer = round(forward_rate * 100, 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
